{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dark Prodigy Simulator</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the robes of the <strong>Dark Lord</strong>, one of the most powerful warriors to ever exist. Your solitude is broken when a gifted yet dangerous exile , a young <strong>White Warrior</strong> cast out from her Academy...seeks you out. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is hungry for power, desperate to surpass everything she once was, and she has chosen you as her master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you shape her into the perfect weapon of darkness, or will her ambition outgrow even you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Lord: The Fallen Apprentice</strong> is a cinematic Simulator/RPG featuring:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An immersive, character-driven storyline</strong><br>Train a prodigy who has already mastered every path of her Academy, but still craves forbidden knowledge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moral corruption system</strong><br>Every lesson you teach her will bring her closer to the darkness \u2014 but can you control what you unleash?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Train, test, and evolve your apprentice</strong><br>Push her through missions, duels, and trials that will determine if she becomes your loyal blade\u2026 or a rival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock forbidden powers</strong><br>Shadow manipulation, destructive telekinetics, and abilities the Academy dared never teach.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic relationship</strong><br>Build trust, break her spirit, or let her ambition grow unchecked. Her fate is tied to your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A destiny in your hands</strong><br>Will she become your greatest triumph\u2026 or the one who destroys you?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your apprentice. Shape the future.<br><strong>Evil is taught and you are the teacher.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even though the game is complete, I plan to do individual updates to expand on the character routes.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3994670?t=1770651534","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3994670?t=1770651534","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994670/40a849c336e04ae501a173db2c1f14eced3243db/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770651534","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994670/40a849c336e04ae501a173db2c1f14eced3243db/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770651534","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,3,4,5],"notes":"This game is intended for adults only includes explicit, sexual content that some viewers may find offensive. The characters, story, and actions are fictitious. All characters are depicted as 18 and over.\r\n\r\nContains nudity, use of alcohol and drugs, graphic depictions of oral, vaginal and non-penetrative sexual acts."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dark Prodigy Simulator</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the robes of the <strong>Dark Lord</strong>, one of the most powerful warriors to ever exist. Your solitude is broken when a gifted yet dangerous exile , a young <strong>White Warrior</strong> cast out from her Academy...seeks you out. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is hungry for power, desperate to surpass everything she once was, and she has chosen you as her master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you shape her into the perfect weapon of darkness, or will her ambition outgrow even you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Lord: The Fallen Apprentice</strong> is a cinematic Simulator/RPG featuring:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An immersive, character-driven storyline</strong><br>Train a prodigy who has already mastered every path of her Academy, but still craves forbidden knowledge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moral corruption system</strong><br>Every lesson you teach her will bring her closer to the darkness \u2014 but can you control what you unleash?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Train, test, and evolve your apprentice</strong><br>Push her through missions, duels, and trials that will determine if she becomes your loyal blade\u2026 or a rival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock forbidden powers</strong><br>Shadow manipulation, destructive telekinetics, and abilities the Academy dared never teach.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic relationship</strong><br>Build trust, break her spirit, or let her ambition grow unchecked. Her fate is tied to your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A destiny in your hands</strong><br>Will she become your greatest triumph\u2026 or the one who destroys you?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your apprentice. Shape the future.<br><strong>Evil is taught and you are the teacher.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even though the game is complete, I plan to do individual updates to expand on the character routes.</p>","developers":["I.T.K"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994670/2ae9b3654f9a7e9e64427f84392052b6dd167f47/header.jpg?t=1770651534","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3994670/411795753/cd0ab58f28c3f5d3cf1cb5cb00954046e7976be6/1770651271/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770651